--- a/dotnet-net11/skills\net11-features\reference\net11-priority-apis.md
+++ b/dotnet-net11/skills\net11-features\reference\net11-priority-apis.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# .NET 11 Priority API Matrix
+
+| Dimension | Prefer | Avoid |
+|---|---|---|
+| Zstandard Compression | `ZstandardStream`, `ZstandardCompressionOptions` | `ZstdSharp` |
+| BFloat16 | `System.Numerics.BFloat16` | manual bit conversions |
+| Rune strings | `string.*(Rune)` APIs | surrogate pair manual logic |
+| HMAC verify | `HMACSHA256.Verify`, `CryptographicOperations.VerifyHmac` | hash then compare manually |
+| FrozenDictionary | expression init for `FrozenDictionary` | `Dictionary` then `ToFrozenDictionary()` |
+| Collection with() | `[with(...), ..values]` | constructor + mutating adds |
+| Union | `union` + exhaustive switch | abstract hierarchy for simple DU |
+| MIME map | `MediaTypeMap.GetMediaType/GetExtension` | hardcoded maps |
+| Division rounding | `Divide/DivRem(..., DivisionRounding.*)` | custom rounding helpers |
+| JSON features | `PascalCase`, `[JsonNamingPolicy]`, type `[JsonIgnore]` | custom naming policy for built-ins |

